1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 4]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:23,500
Keep watch on Unit 401!

14
00:03:30,670 --> 00:03:31,680
Fifth Master!

15
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,650
All the capable ones are already down there.

16
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,290
We useless lot should wait

17
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,680
and see what happens first.

18
00:03:55,230 --> 00:03:55,900
Let's stop here.

19
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,380
Zhang Qishan's soldiers

20
00:04:01,790 --> 00:04:03,020
seem neither human nor ghost.

21
00:04:03,710 --> 00:04:04,540
This wretched tower

22
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,580
really is sinister.

23
00:04:07,070 --> 00:04:08,580
Who knows whether it has anything

24
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:09,900
to do with that shadow he's chasing.

25
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,180
After we came in,

26
00:04:15,710 --> 00:04:17,130
your attitude toward Zhang Qishan

27
00:04:17,690 --> 00:04:19,040
seemed to have changed.

28
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:23,740
Yes.

29
00:04:25,150 --> 00:04:26,660
He does know what he's doing.

30
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,130
I'm still testing his limits.

31
00:04:29,230 --> 00:04:30,020
Until I know them,

32
00:04:30,710 --> 00:04:31,460
I'll humor him

33
00:04:32,150 --> 00:04:33,100
and let him lower his guard.

34
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,250
That sounds more like you.

35
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,770
I'll go on ahead

36
00:04:40,150 --> 00:04:41,440
and scout the way for Ding Qiansui.

37
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:43,410
We can meet up anytime afterward,

38
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:44,300
the usual way.

39
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:46,530
It's not time yet.

40
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:47,660
You can't leave.

41
00:04:48,790 --> 00:04:49,250
Besides...

42
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:53,370
I need your help too.

43
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:56,210
I'll help you afterward.

44
00:04:58,630 --> 00:04:59,050
Madam Huo,

45
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,330
Your Highness, Your Excellency,

46
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,590
Your Majesty, Matriarch Huo.

47
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,810
So many honorifics.

48
00:05:07,550 --> 00:05:09,490
Which one am I?

49
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,180
That depends

50
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:14,020
on which one you prefer.

51
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:27,650
Haven't we been here before?

52
00:05:27,950 --> 00:05:28,330
Here?

53
00:05:33,550 --> 00:05:34,140
No, we haven't.

54
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,460
Why?

55
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:37,650
Do you think

56
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,210
we might've passed through here

57
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:41,370
when we were lost?

58
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:42,700
Impossible.

59
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:44,700
I have an excellent memory.

60
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,860
We've never been here.

61
00:05:52,670 --> 00:05:53,370
Let's look farther ahead.

62
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,540
Eighth Master,

63
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,410
what exactly

64
00:07:36,510 --> 00:07:37,410
was that shadow just now?

65
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,170
It didn't look human.

66
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:42,540
What does the divination say?

67
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:44,730
The results

68
00:07:44,990 --> 00:07:46,400
aren't very accurate right now.

69
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,220
There's no sunlight down here.

70
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,700
Tell us anyway.

71
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:55,100
When did you hurt your hand?

72
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:57,930
I don't know.

73
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,410
I didn't notice.

74
00:08:02,140 --> 00:08:02,560
Huh.

75
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,050
It's safe down here.

76
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:07,700
Come on down.

77
00:08:08,190 --> 00:08:10,460
Stinky Yu, you went down by yourself.

78
00:08:10,830 --> 00:08:11,730
How am I going to get down?

79
00:08:12,190 --> 00:08:12,580
Eighth Master,

80
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,050
why don't you come with us?

81
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,140
That'd be great.

82
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,220
Don't worry, Eighth Master.

83
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,290
We'll keep you safe.

84
00:08:25,430 --> 00:08:26,250
Many thanks.

85
00:08:32,670 --> 00:08:33,100
Eighth Master.

86
00:08:35,670 --> 00:08:37,100
You scared me half to death!

87
00:08:37,310 --> 00:08:38,100
It's all right.

88
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:38,930
You're safe now.

89
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:39,940
Come on, get up.

90
00:08:40,910 --> 00:08:41,410
Eighth Master.

91
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,370
Where did you go?

92
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,010
Master Zhang told you to look after me.

93
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,010
Yet you left me behind.

94
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:49,010
Come with me.

95
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,100
Come with you?

96
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:51,940
Master Zhang told you to stay here.

97
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,300
Why are we leaving?

98
00:08:56,270 --> 00:08:57,250
Where are we going?

99
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,130
Wait, Yu.

100
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:02,820
If you've got business to handle,

101
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,580
I won't get in your way.

102
00:09:05,110 --> 00:09:06,720
I'll wait over there.

103
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:07,950
Over there.

104
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,180
I can't disobey Master's orders.

105
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,340
You must stay beside me.

106
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,290
Wait...

107
00:09:14,910 --> 00:09:15,460
Oh, dear.

108
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,060
Fifth Master.

109
00:09:42,150 --> 00:09:42,650
Where's Master Zhang?

110
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,650
Your Master had business to attend to.

111
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:47,770
He told me

112
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:51,700
to come back and take charge.

113
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:13,370
They're still alive,

114
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,490
but completely unresponsive.

115
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,760
Laogou.

116
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:37,660
Laogou,

117
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:38,610
could they

118
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,460
have been given

119
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:43,060
some anesthetic?

120
00:10:44,030 --> 00:10:46,100
Could that be why their pupils won't constrict?

121
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,650
Could it be

122
00:10:51,390 --> 00:10:52,650
that the shadow was controlling Unit 401?

123
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,730
Now that the shadow is gone,

124
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,580
Unit 401 has stopped moving too.

125
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,100
But what exactly is that shadow?

126
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,490
And how did it control them?

127
00:11:07,030 --> 00:11:07,820
Bizarre.

128
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,650
Absolutely bizarre.

129
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,100
Speak plainly.

130
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:14,890
Laogou.

131
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:21,610
Laogou,

132
00:11:22,270 --> 00:11:24,460
I examined them closely just now.

133
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:27,250
Their breathing is extremely faint.

134
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,890
Normally,

135
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,730
they shouldn't even be able to stand.

136
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,770
But every muscle in their bodies

137
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,130
is completely tense,

138
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,130
as if they're ready for battle.

139
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:37,730
Are their lives in danger?

140
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:41,730
For now,

141
00:11:42,630 --> 00:11:43,940
all I can say is they're still alive.

142
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:45,850
But

143
00:11:46,670 --> 00:11:48,100
they don't look

144
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,940
like they're possessed either.

145
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:51,700
Laogou,

146
00:11:52,910 --> 00:11:54,890
given the situation,

147
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:55,940
I think

148
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,220
here's what we should do.

149
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:00,650
We should lead Unit 401 out at once

150
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:03,580
before they're controlled again.

151
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,530
Master Zhang is highly capable.

152
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,980
He can surely protect himself.

153
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:09,100
We can leave him a message on the wall

154
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,340
and wait for him outside.

155
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:11,700
What do you think?

156
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,530
I thought

157
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:16,300
you'd become Zhang Qishan's lackey.

158
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,180
It seems I misjudged you.

159
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,940
I'm fine with that.

160
00:12:21,510 --> 00:12:23,340
I came down here to find Unit 401.

161
00:12:24,030 --> 00:12:25,010
Now that we've found them,

162
00:12:25,630 --> 00:12:26,340
it's time to leave.

163
00:12:28,870 --> 00:12:30,100
Are we leaving or not,

164
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,610
Puppy Zhang?

165
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:33,730
Until Master returns,

166
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:34,730
none of us are leaving.

167
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,420
Eighth Master.

168
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,060
Before entering the tower, Master specifically ordered me

169
00:12:40,870 --> 00:12:41,730
to keep your mouth in check.

170
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,770
Keep talking nonsense, and I'll seal it shut.

171
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,180
According to our agreement,

172
00:12:47,670 --> 00:12:49,130
once Master Zhang returns,

173
00:12:49,270 --> 00:12:50,850
he'll have to leave the Mystic Nine.

174
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,680
Surely he isn't planning

175
00:12:53,970 --> 00:12:54,710
to break his word, is he?

176
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:55,820
Don't worry.

177
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:57,820
Master will keep his word.

178
00:12:59,670 --> 00:13:00,180
Good.

179
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:01,820
Then we'll wait.

180
00:13:03,390 --> 00:13:07,130
I'll await Master Zhang right here.

181
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:16,650
That's strange.

182
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,650
Only Unit 401's soldiers are here.

183
00:14:24,030 --> 00:14:25,250
The medics, patients,

184
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:27,100
and the men guarding the entrance are all missing.

185
00:14:28,630 --> 00:14:30,490
Could they have split into two groups?

186
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:33,980
Could someone have sent these soldiers out

187
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:36,340
to lure us into a trap?

188
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,650
Must you always suspect everything, Tiezui?

189
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:39,940
Could it simply be

190
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:41,890
that some of them couldn't keep up?

191
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:42,940
Tiezui,

192
00:14:43,670 --> 00:14:45,730
why not just ask Unit 401 yourself?

193
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:48,490
You and the Otherworld Patriarch are in the same trade.

194
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:50,610
Perhaps they'll show you some respect.

195
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:53,850
No need.

196
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,180
Has the shadow returned?

197
00:15:06,790 --> 00:15:07,610
Then where's Master Zhang?

198
00:15:16,550 --> 00:15:17,610
They're being controlled again.

199
00:16:16,150 --> 00:16:17,220
Block them!

200
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:17,890
Yes!

201
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:18,850
Nobody move!

202
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,060
There are only a few of you.

203
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,700
How many can you stop?

204
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,850
What do you suggest, Fifth Master?

205
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:31,980
I say we follow them

206
00:16:32,510 --> 00:16:33,770
and see where they're going.

207
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:38,180
I thought only Master Zhang would act rashly.

208
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,730
But it seems, Laogou,

209
00:16:40,240 --> 00:16:41,300
your methods

210
00:16:41,510 --> 00:16:42,730
are no less audacious.

211
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,420
Audacious? What do you mean?

212
00:16:45,390 --> 00:16:46,250
Didn't you say

213
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:47,770
there must be

214
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,610
a scheme behind all this?

215
00:16:49,510 --> 00:16:50,610
So let's follow them

216
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,650
and see what it is.

217
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:54,120
No.

218
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:55,850
Master Zhang said that.

219
00:17:38,590 --> 00:17:39,140
Laogou,

220
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,980
if they're moving

221
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,860
under the shadow's control,

222
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:46,140
why are they still moving

223
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:48,700
when Master Zhang has gone after it?

224
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:50,860
Even if it isn't the shadow,

225
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,490
something else must be controlling them.

226
00:17:54,750 --> 00:17:56,570
Otherwise, Runty wouldn't be this frightened.

227
00:17:58,310 --> 00:17:59,220
I don't know why,

228
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,220
but I feel like we reek

229
00:18:01,830 --> 00:18:03,220
like the dead.

230
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,530
You're the one who reeks of death.

231
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:42,860
Watch out!

232
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:43,410
Nobody move!

233
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,660
Where's Unit 401?

234
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:54,810
Where did they go?

235
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:58,770
They vanished in the blink of an eye.

236
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,530
Did you hear any footsteps just now?

237
00:20:14,550 --> 00:20:15,490
The footprints end here.

238
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:16,770
How could

239
00:20:17,830 --> 00:20:19,730
so many people just vanish into thin air?

240
00:20:21,030 --> 00:20:22,420
I refuse to believe this.

241
00:20:23,830 --> 00:20:24,380
Keep searching.

242
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,050
- Yes. - Yes.

243
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:44,660
Runty.

244
00:20:49,550 --> 00:20:50,050
Runty.

245
00:20:51,270 --> 00:20:51,770
Runty.

246
00:20:58,720 --> 00:20:59,490
How can this be?

247
00:21:00,750 --> 00:21:02,220
Runty can't pick up their scent anymore.

248
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:07,460
Master, should we go back and check?

249
00:21:08,310 --> 00:21:09,220
Could we have

250
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:10,380
gotten ahead of them?

251
00:21:23,310 --> 00:21:24,010
How could

252
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:26,250
so many people vanish right under our noses?

253
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:27,460
There were over 100 of them.

254
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,620
Even if they'd vaporized,

255
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,180
they should've left some trace on the ground.

256
00:21:30,270 --> 00:21:31,290
If they'd really vaporized,

257
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:33,900
the trace should be on the ceiling.

258
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,090
It's this tower.

259
00:21:43,310 --> 00:21:44,530
This tower is playing tricks on us.

260
00:21:48,830 --> 00:21:49,290
Laogou,

261
00:21:49,790 --> 00:21:51,250
everyone's at a loss.

262
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:52,730
Say something

263
00:21:53,310 --> 00:21:54,380
to put them at ease.

264
00:21:55,110 --> 00:21:56,050
Exactly, Master.

265
00:21:56,590 --> 00:21:58,860
We're helping Zhang Qishan find his men.

266
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:01,490
Let's not get everyone killed doing it.

267
00:22:52,270 --> 00:22:53,090
Runty sniffed the ceiling.

268
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:53,940
No reaction.

269
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:54,810
Master.

270
00:22:57,790 --> 00:22:58,460
Runty.

271
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:00,900
How could their scent just vanish like that?

272
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,380
That proves there's

273
00:23:04,350 --> 00:23:04,980
no hollow space above.

274
00:23:10,310 --> 00:23:10,900
This is bad.

275
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:13,770
Tiezui was right.

276
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:15,940
This tower has come alive.

277
00:23:17,310 --> 00:23:18,050
Remember how,

278
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,220
deep in the woods,

279
00:23:21,270 --> 00:23:22,290
you sometimes

280
00:23:22,480 --> 00:23:23,570
come across ancient temples

281
00:23:24,270 --> 00:23:26,090
with human faces painted on the walls?

282
00:23:27,070 --> 00:23:28,050
The elders say

283
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,620
that if a temple with painted faces

284
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:31,250
stands in the woods long enough,

285
00:23:32,160 --> 00:23:33,250
it will come alive.

286
00:23:34,510 --> 00:23:35,730
Once someone steps inside,

287
00:23:36,590 --> 00:23:38,220
it toys with them endlessly.

288
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:42,140
Tianpeng,

289
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,050
remember that time we...?

290
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:53,980
Tianpeng... Tianpeng!

291
00:23:54,790 --> 00:23:57,460
- Tianpeng! - Tianpeng!

292
00:23:59,000 --> 00:23:59,570
Tianpeng!

293
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:01,140
Tianpeng!

294
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:06,290
Tianpeng!

295
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:09,900
Master,

296
00:24:10,510 --> 00:24:11,530
Tianpeng was just here.

297
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,050
How did he suddenly disappear?

298
00:24:14,440 --> 00:24:15,770
Did Unit 401 take him?

299
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:17,330
Enough of this trickery.

300
00:24:20,830 --> 00:24:22,250
I don't care what it is or what powers it has.

301
00:24:23,350 --> 00:24:23,860
Boys,

302
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:26,490
split up and find Tianpeng!

303
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:28,050
- Yes! - Search!

304
00:24:28,890 --> 00:24:30,220
- Tianpeng! - Tianpeng!

305
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:31,460
Tianpeng!

306
00:24:57,340 --> 00:25:00,540
[Liunian Hall]

307
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:02,420
Master...

308
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:07,010
Master!

309
00:25:08,350 --> 00:25:08,900
Did you find him?

310
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:11,090
Master,

311
00:25:12,070 --> 00:25:12,860
this gate wasn't here before.

312
00:25:18,030 --> 00:25:18,810
What's going on, Master?

313
00:25:19,350 --> 00:25:20,050
We haven't found Tianpeng,

314
00:25:20,350 --> 00:25:21,730
but this gate appeared out of nowhere.

315
00:25:23,070 --> 00:25:24,900
I'm afraid Laogou was right.

316
00:25:26,110 --> 00:25:27,290
This tower has come alive

317
00:25:28,070 --> 00:25:29,180
and is playing with us.

318
00:25:29,180 --> 00:25:30,420
[Gate to Liunian Hall]

319
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:31,490
Juanlian, Tiezui,

320
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:33,570
you two come in with me.

321
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:35,860
Zhenyuan, you and the others stand guard outside.

322
00:25:36,350 --> 00:25:36,810
Yes, Master.

323
00:25:37,180 --> 00:25:37,920
Laogou.

324
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:40,380
Do we have to go in?

325
00:25:41,510 --> 00:25:41,980
Tiezui,

326
00:25:42,790 --> 00:25:43,900
I won't force you

327
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,460
if you don't want to.

328
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:48,860
But the tower may invite you in.

329
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,210
You've already seen

330
00:25:51,210 --> 00:25:52,000
how it invites people.

331
00:25:52,070 --> 00:25:53,460
I'd hate for you to be locked outside alone.

332
00:25:53,790 --> 00:25:54,930
Don't scare me.

333
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,980
Zhenyuan and the others are out here.

334
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:57,460
Fine.

335
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:58,770
I understand.

336
00:26:00,350 --> 00:26:01,490
So to you,

337
00:26:02,240 --> 00:26:03,330
Master Zhang is still more reliable.

338
00:26:04,920 --> 00:26:05,420
Laogou,

339
00:26:05,590 --> 00:26:06,770
that's unfair.

340
00:26:07,510 --> 00:26:08,140
Fine.

341
00:26:09,270 --> 00:26:10,570
I'll go in with you, all right?

342
00:26:15,940 --> 00:26:20,100
[Liunian Hall]

343
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:50,530
Tianpeng.

344
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:51,810
Unit 401.

345
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:55,530
Tianpeng!

346
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:57,570
Unit 401!

347
00:26:58,030 --> 00:26:58,530
Master,

348
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:01,900
do you think that creature is inside too?

349
00:27:02,270 --> 00:27:04,700
The tower itself is the creature.

350
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:05,530
Will you be quiet?

351
00:27:14,030 --> 00:27:15,050
Runty stays outside

352
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:16,860
to keep watch with you.

353
00:27:50,500 --> 00:27:52,580
[Liunian Hall]

354
00:27:58,550 --> 00:28:00,220
Stinky Yu, give me that.

355
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:28,810
More trickery.

356
00:28:29,960 --> 00:28:30,900
There's no one here.

357
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,140
Wait.

358
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:40,980
This is very strange.

359
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:46,980
What is it?

360
00:28:48,310 --> 00:28:49,050
The Thunder Patriarch Seal.

361
00:28:50,110 --> 00:28:52,700
It's a hand seal used to subdue evil

362
00:28:53,030 --> 00:28:54,330
and command spirits to uphold the Way.

363
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:57,050
There's something behind this wall.

364
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:59,180
Speak plainly.

365
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:01,220
Laogou, look.

366
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:03,250
This entire hall was built

367
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:05,770
to suppress what's behind it.

368
00:29:06,470 --> 00:29:08,980
Whatever's there must be dangerous.

369
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,380
By your reasoning,

370
00:29:15,310 --> 00:29:16,880
this hall appeared out of nowhere

371
00:29:17,510 --> 00:29:18,700
to lure us here and make us

372
00:29:19,310 --> 00:29:20,570
dig out what's behind the wall?

373
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:24,660
I understand now.

374
00:29:25,680 --> 00:29:26,900
The Otherworld Patriarch sealed

375
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:28,010
the tower's manifested body

376
00:29:28,270 --> 00:29:29,330
inside this wall.

377
00:29:29,920 --> 00:29:31,770
So the creature caused all this

378
00:29:32,070 --> 00:29:33,010
to lure us here

379
00:29:33,310 --> 00:29:34,570
and use us

380
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:35,460
to break the seal

381
00:29:35,680 --> 00:29:36,620
and set it free.

382
00:29:37,830 --> 00:29:38,460
Impossible.

383
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,380
That's not what it wants.

384
00:29:43,790 --> 00:29:44,770
How can you be so sure?

385
00:29:47,350 --> 00:29:48,420
If it truly wanted us

386
00:29:48,590 --> 00:29:49,810
to release that thing,

387
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:50,980
then after we came down,

388
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:51,730
the first place we'd reach

389
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,220
would've been Liunian Hall,

390
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:54,980
not those corridors outside.

391
00:29:55,510 --> 00:29:56,900
It wouldn't have made us chase Unit 401

392
00:29:57,310 --> 00:29:58,660
and then taken Tianpeng.

393
00:29:59,070 --> 00:30:00,420
If that isn't the case,

394
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,460
why did this Liunian Hall

395
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:05,250
appear at all?

396
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:42,460
If it truly has some purpose,

397
00:30:44,750 --> 00:30:46,050
we'll know soon enough.

398
00:30:53,270 --> 00:30:53,660
Zhenyuan?

399
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,010
Zhenyuan!

400
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:56,140
Zhenyuan!

401
00:30:58,550 --> 00:30:59,180
Zhenyuan!

402
00:30:59,960 --> 00:31:00,460
Where is he?

403
00:31:00,750 --> 00:31:01,380
Zhenyuan!

404
00:31:08,830 --> 00:31:09,290
Zhenyuan.

405
00:31:16,750 --> 00:31:18,660
Zhenyuan, weren't you just...?

406
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:32,010
Tianpeng.

407
00:31:34,640 --> 00:31:35,360
Tianpeng?

408
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:42,140
Master,

409
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:43,700
how did they get inside?

410
00:32:12,860 --> 00:32:13,980
[Liunian Hall]

411
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:24,810
Master Zhang!

412
00:32:29,270 --> 00:32:29,980
Why are you here?

413
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:34,180
Where are my men and my dog?

414
00:32:35,200 --> 00:32:35,900
I haven't seen them.

415
00:32:36,790 --> 00:32:37,220
What?

416
00:32:39,590 --> 00:32:41,010
Tianpeng! Zhenyuan!

417
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:41,900
Zhenyuan!

418
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,290
- Why are you here, Master Zhang?
- Tianpeng!

419
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:47,570
- We were just inside... - Zhenyuan!

420
00:32:47,830 --> 00:32:48,660
But you weren't there.

421
00:32:49,110 --> 00:32:50,140
I chased the shadow here

422
00:32:50,550 --> 00:32:51,180
and never left.

423
00:32:51,830 --> 00:32:52,490
Where's the shadow?

424
00:32:53,110 --> 00:32:53,810
It got away.

425
00:32:55,110 --> 00:32:55,730
Wait, Master Zhang.

426
00:32:56,350 --> 00:32:58,290
Are you sure you've been here all along?

427
00:32:58,830 --> 00:32:59,620
I'm certain.

428
00:33:14,590 --> 00:33:16,050
Don't make me burn you down.

429
00:33:18,920 --> 00:33:19,900
What happened?

430
00:33:22,790 --> 00:33:23,490
Where's Unit 401?

431
00:33:43,350 --> 00:33:45,570
If this tower really plays tricks on people

432
00:33:46,070 --> 00:33:46,770
like you say,

433
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:48,330
what does it want?

434
00:33:48,790 --> 00:33:51,090
Such beings are hard to fathom.

435
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:53,180
They don't think logically like people.

436
00:33:53,510 --> 00:33:55,730
They often act on a whim.

437
00:33:56,750 --> 00:33:57,290
Zhang Qishan,

438
00:33:59,310 --> 00:34:00,530
what exactly was that shadow?

439
00:34:01,350 --> 00:34:02,180
Did you see it clearly?

440
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:03,220
No.

441
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:04,770
It was extremely fast,

442
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:06,620
but definitely not human.

443
00:34:07,350 --> 00:34:08,420
No human could lose me.

444
00:34:10,590 --> 00:34:11,300
If it wasn't human,

445
00:34:12,590 --> 00:34:13,570
then it was a ghost.

446
00:34:14,590 --> 00:34:15,490
Now the ghost is gone,

447
00:34:16,440 --> 00:34:17,420
and my men have vanished too.

448
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:19,380
How interesting.

449
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:23,380
Here's the deal.

450
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:25,650
From now on,

451
00:34:26,110 --> 00:34:27,010
you help find my men,

452
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:28,820
and I'll help find yours.

453
00:34:30,280 --> 00:34:30,820
Then we'll

454
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:33,530
be even.

455
00:34:38,070 --> 00:34:38,530
Master Zhang!

456
00:34:48,190 --> 00:34:48,900
It's hollow.

457
00:34:50,360 --> 00:34:50,860
Hollow?

458
00:35:01,510 --> 00:35:02,260
I hear water inside.

459
00:35:10,400 --> 00:35:10,780
Master.

460
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:11,380
Keep going.

461
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:28,690
It's a waterway,

462
00:35:29,280 --> 00:35:30,570
probably the building's drainage system.

463
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:32,860
Could the shadow have gone in?

464
00:35:45,070 --> 00:35:46,570
Master, there's no echo.

465
00:35:47,230 --> 00:35:48,130
There's no telling how long

466
00:35:48,550 --> 00:35:49,260
this waterway is.

467
00:35:49,630 --> 00:35:50,460
It must

468
00:35:51,320 --> 00:35:52,420
run deep into the mountain.

469
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:54,460
Fifth Master!

470
00:36:01,030 --> 00:36:01,860
Fifth Master!

471
00:36:04,070 --> 00:36:04,650
Tianpeng?

472
00:36:10,070 --> 00:36:10,840
Tianpeng!

473
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:11,610
Tianpeng!

474
00:36:11,800 --> 00:36:13,650
Boys, grab your weapons! Save Tianpeng!

475
00:36:13,710 --> 00:36:14,530
- Yes! - Don't rush in!

476
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,740
Tianpeng appeared too conveniently,

477
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:22,380
as if he was being shown to us.

478
00:36:23,190 --> 00:36:24,280
Besides, the wall was sealed.

479
00:36:24,670 --> 00:36:25,740
How did Tianpeng get inside?

480
00:36:26,510 --> 00:36:27,820
It's hard not to suspect a trap.

481
00:36:30,190 --> 00:36:30,610
Master Zhang.

482
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:32,940
Adjutant,

483
00:36:33,920 --> 00:36:34,420
scout ahead.

484
00:36:36,230 --> 00:36:36,570
Yes.

485
00:36:43,150 --> 00:36:44,460
If the tower

486
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:46,490
wants us to go inside...

487
00:36:51,920 --> 00:36:53,940
But no one could fit through at this height.

488
00:36:55,570 --> 00:36:56,210
Master Zhang.

489
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:02,130
What is he doing?

490
00:37:03,510 --> 00:37:04,460
The water is flowing.

491
00:37:05,190 --> 00:37:05,610
Eighth Master,

492
00:37:06,070 --> 00:37:07,200
I can lie on the plank

493
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:08,980
and let the current carry me

494
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:11,300
deeper into the waterway.

495
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:12,210
Xiaojin.

496
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:22,780
What's the thread for?

497
00:37:23,670 --> 00:37:25,050
It's a special thread from the Zhang Clan.

498
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:25,900
It's extremely strong.

499
00:37:26,840 --> 00:37:27,900
We'll tie it to the back of the plank.

500
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:29,340
That way, if I run into danger,

501
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:31,050
you can pull me out quickly.

502
00:37:43,630 --> 00:37:44,090
Be careful.

503
00:37:44,800 --> 00:37:45,460
Don't worry, Master.

504
00:39:09,980 --> 00:39:14,140
♪The past fades like smoke♪

505
00:39:14,500 --> 00:39:17,220
♪A choice is made in silence♪

506
00:39:17,500 --> 00:39:20,300
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

507
00:39:20,700 --> 00:39:24,460
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

508
00:39:24,700 --> 00:39:28,140
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

509
00:39:28,420 --> 00:39:31,820
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

510
00:39:31,900 --> 00:39:39,180
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

511
00:39:39,620 --> 00:39:42,900
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

512
00:39:43,180 --> 00:39:46,420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

513
00:39:46,580 --> 00:39:50,620
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

514
00:39:50,820 --> 00:39:54,180
♪Who believes in fate?♪

515
00:39:54,420 --> 00:39:57,780
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

516
00:39:58,020 --> 00:40:01,300
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

517
00:40:01,620 --> 00:40:05,300
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

518
00:40:05,500 --> 00:40:08,740
♪Take care♪

519
00:40:08,740 --> 00:40:11,300
♪We once raced♪

520
00:40:11,380 --> 00:40:13,300
♪For the dawn♪

521
00:40:13,460 --> 00:40:16,740
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

522
00:40:16,860 --> 00:40:20,140
♪In the web of fate♪

523
00:40:20,140 --> 00:40:23,340
♪No one can escape♪

524
00:40:24,340 --> 00:40:26,180
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

525
00:40:26,340 --> 00:40:27,900
♪We too were young once♪

526
00:40:27,980 --> 00:40:31,420
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

527
00:40:31,620 --> 00:40:33,940
♪Keep the ember lit♪

528
00:40:34,060 --> 00:40:38,580
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

529
00:40:38,700 --> 00:40:41,660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

530
00:40:41,900 --> 00:40:45,420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

531
00:40:45,540 --> 00:40:49,300
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

532
00:40:49,620 --> 00:40:53,100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

533
00:40:53,260 --> 00:40:56,260
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

534
00:40:56,500 --> 00:41:00,260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

535
00:41:00,420 --> 00:41:04,140
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

536
00:41:04,260 --> 00:41:15,700
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
